EHEPS AI Startup

«EHEPS International Organization — AI, Cloud, Web3, CUDA, and Humanitarian Technology Initiative»

EHEPS AI Startup is the technology and innovation initiative of EHEPS International Organization, developing responsible AI, cloud computing, Web3 systems, Stellar blockchain analytics, GPU computing, and digital humanitarian technologies.

🌍 EHEPS International Organization

EHEPS International Organization is a nonprofit organization dedicated to education, humanitarian assistance, environmental sustainability, community development, digital inclusion, and responsible technology.

Our official organization websites are:

- EHEPS International Organization: https://eheps.com
- EHEPS: https://eheps.org
- GitHub: https://github.com/EHESPO/Eheps_ai-startup

EHEPS's public website describes its work across education, humanitarian assistance, environmental sustainability, community development, and related social services.

---

☁️ EHEPS International Organization in the Google Cloud Ecosystem

EHEPS International Organization is developing its AI and cloud technology platform within the Google Cloud startup ecosystem.

The EHEPS AI Startup initiative is focused on building cloud-native AI and Web3 technologies using modern infrastructure, data analytics, GPU computing, and responsible AI practices.

Our technology roadmap includes:

- Google Cloud infrastructure
- Gemini and AI technologies
- Cloud-based AI agents
- Data analytics
- Web3 and blockchain analytics
- Stellar Horizon integration
- NVIDIA CUDA GPU computing
- Humanitarian technology
- Multilingual AI
- Open-source software

Google Cloud's current startup program provides eligible startups with cloud credits, technical resources, training, business support, and ecosystem benefits. AI startups can be eligible for enhanced benefits under the program, subject to Google's eligibility requirements and approval.

